# Executable command examples

These examples use the same deterministic minimal Mach-O builder as unit,
fuzz, and benchmark coverage.

```console
$ macho info tests/cmd/fixture.macho
Thin Mach-O binary (32 bytes)
...
```

```console
$ macho snapshot --format json tests/cmd/fixture.macho
{
...
  "command": "snapshot",
...
  "ok": true,
  "schema_version": 1
}

```

```console
$ macho not-a-command
? 2
Error: error: unrecognized subcommand 'not-a-command'

Usage: macho <COMMAND> [OPTIONS]

For more information, try '--help'.

```
